  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Out at the open-plan desks, senior producer Xingzi tells Bu Xiaogu the truth about why Wang Er was dismissed and offers her a place in the chief editor's office, while Chun Yuqiao drops off her next urgent task. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "布小谷，你现在在总编室工作了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "如果你愿意，毕业以后可以留在星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那王尔老师呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他把艺人方案透露给竞争对手了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "王尔要负责，已经被公司开除了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们为什么要这么对他？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这份工作，你要还是不要？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这个是你的下一个任务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们要做明星之夜的艺人初选。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果你准备留下，明天给我结果。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "布小谷，你现在在总编室工作了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bu Xiaogu, you work in the chief editor's office now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "如果你愿意，毕业以后可以留在星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you are willing, you can stay at Xingtian after graduation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那王尔老师呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then what about Wang Er?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他把艺人方案透露给竞争对手了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He leaked the artist plan to our competitor.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "王尔要负责，已经被公司开除了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wang Er had to take responsibility and has already been fired by the company.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你们为什么要这么对他？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did you have to treat him like that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did we do wrong?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这份工作，你要还是不要？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This job — do you want it or not?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这个是你的下一个任务。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is your next assignment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我们要做明星之夜的艺人初选。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We need to do the first round of artist picks for Star Night.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果你准备留下，明天给我结果。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you plan to stay, give me the results tomorrow.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
